OL,9,FA woman who was unconscious while raped
OL,10,Fby her husband and sexually assaulted
OL,11,Fby other men was knocked out with drugs
OL,12,Fthat could have killed her, a jury has
OL,13,Fbeen told.
OL,15,FAt Minshull Street Crown Court,
OL,16,Fprosecutor Louise Oakley told the jury
OL,17,Fthe victim, from the Stockport area,
OL,18,Fwas found to have 11 non-prescribed
OL,19,Fdrugs in her system including morphine,
OL,20,Fketamine, diazepam, cocaine and
OL,21,Fzolpidem.
